{"title":"Career Roadmap · Digital Manufacturing Engineer","role":"Digital Manufacturing Engineer","summary":"A Digital Manufacturing Engineer combines manufacturing engineering, CAD/CAM, automation, data analytics and digital technologies to improve how products are designed, simulated, manufactured, monitored and optimized.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E. (Bachelor of Technology / Engineering)","Course":"Digital Manufacturing & Design"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Digital Manufacturing Engineer combines manufacturing engineering, CAD/CAM, automation, data analytics and digital technologies to improve how products are designed, simulated, manufactured, monitored and optimized."},{"type":"p","text":"The role sits at the intersection of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mechanical engineering"},{"text":"Manufacturing processes"},{"text":"CAD/CAM"},{"text":"CNC machining"},{"text":"Industrial automation"},{"text":"Robotics"},{"text":"IoT"},{"text":"Data analytics"},{"text":"Digital twins"},{"text":"Additive manufacturing"},{"text":"MES/ERP systems"},{"text":"Quality engineering"},{"text":"Industry 4.0"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest profile is not simply a CAD designer. It is an engineer who can connect:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Product Design","Manufacturing Process","Machine Data","Automation","Quality","Optimization"]},{"type":"h","text":"Career Flow"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Tech / B.E.","Manufacturing + Mechanical Fundamentals","CAD / CAM + CNC","Automation + PLC + Robotics","Industrial IoT + Data Analytics","Digital Manufacturing Systems","Digital Twin + Simulation","Industry 4.0 Projects","Digital Manufacturing Engineer","Senior Digital Manufacturing Engineer","Smart Manufacturing / Industry 4.0 Lead","Digital Manufacturing Architect"]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","he